    "| Recording Year      | 2017                            |                                 \n",
    "| Published           | 2021                            |                                 \n",
    "| Sensor              | 3D LiDAR / Time-of-Flight       |                                 \n",
    "| Resolution          | 20 × 25                         |                                 \n",
    "| Channels            | 1 (depth)                       |                                 \n",
    "| FPS                 | 10                              |                                 \n",
    "| Number of Sequences | 12,956                          |                                 \n",
    "| Boarding Events     | ~26,243                         |                                 \n",
    "| Alighting Events    | ~26,164                         |                                 \n",
    "| File Format         | HDF5 + CSV                      |                                 \n",
